WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.370
I won't believe that!

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.970
Because Tachyon Dragon would never betray me like that!

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.570
Mizael...

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.240
Kaito! The greatest Dragon Tamer <i>is me</i>!

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:17.550
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon, attack him directly!

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.220
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.050
Barianlight, release!

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.460
Kaito!

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.970
At this rate, Kaito will...!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.860
Kaito!

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.200
Brother...!

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:41.000
Are you allright, Kaito-<i>sama</i>?

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.350
Don't pointlessly worry about things!

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:46.750
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, if I'm reduced to scrap,

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.200
can you please tell Obomi-<i>san</i> about how bravely I fought.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.240
I won't.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.750
You tell her yourself!

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.190
Kaito-<i>sama</i>...

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:58.200
Kaito...

00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.600
Brother...!

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.640
Good luck, darling!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.260
That voice...

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:06.730
Obomi-<i>san</i>!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:11.350
I shall not disgrace myself by losing here!

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:16.450
{marker}

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:20.630
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:25.870
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:37.560
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:41.740
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.560
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:52.540
the feelings I want to express.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:02:01.560
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.810
Right now, with you

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:08.740
Oh - By facing each other,

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:15.820
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:20.920
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:26.350
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:31.520
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:41.100
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:47.890
Kaito!

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:52.810
With this... I end my turn.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:57.900
<i>The Future Lies within This Hand!
Climax of the Galaxy Showdown!!</i>

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.070
Looks like you just managed to hold on.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.990
Ka- Kaito-<i>sama</i>, are you all right, please?

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:07.040
Yeah. How about you?

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.330
50% of me is significantly damaged.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:16.090
Kaito, there are no monsters left on your field and your hand is zero.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.300
You are still fighting on in that condition?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.510
My turn...

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.800
<i>This is... my destiny draw...</i>

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:33.190
Kaito-sama, while you're that weak, let your Orbital assist you.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.230
This is my and...
my humble...

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.610
... Destiny draw!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.160
It came...if anything, this will...

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.490
I set one monster face down.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.080
I end my turn with that.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.580
So, you've set some small fry monster out of desperation?

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.790
My turn, draw!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.010
I activate the Spell Card "Galactic Charity"!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:05.260
With the effect of this card, I send one card to the graveyard

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:07.930
and draw two from my deck!

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:12.190
I activate the Quick-Play Spell "Tachyon Refresh"!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.480
This banishes one monster from my field.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.190
I banish my Neo Tachyon.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:24.410
With this, the "Re-Galaxy" equipped to my Neo Tachyon is sent to the Graeyard.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.950
And then, the banished monster returns to the field!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.870
You banished Neo Tachyon so it regained its original Attack?

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:38.800
And now I activate the Equip Spell Card "Tachyon Downfall Cannon"

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:45.380
By equipping this card to Neo Tachyon, it loses 500 ATK but...

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:51.220
... after a battle ends, I can halve its attack, allowing it to attack again!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.770
Additionally, until Neo Tachyon's ATK would go lower than 500,

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.900
I can use this effect over and again!

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.650
That's...! But then Kaito will...!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:06.490
Go, Neo Tachyon! Attack his defending card!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.800
Galaxy Mirror Sage's Flip Effect activates!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:25.130
I gain 800 Life Points.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.390
And then, when this card is destroyed,

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.470
It can set itself back onto the field!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.730
Futile resistance.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.980
After the card is set back onto the field by this effect,

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.530
it will be banished when it leaves the field.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:47.200
I activate the effect of my "Tachyon Downfall Cannon"!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:51.160
After the equipped monster attacks, it can halve its ATK,

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.450
allowing it to attack once again!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.710
Neo Tachyon, attack once more!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:02.420
My "Galaxy Mirror Sage's" effect activates!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.090
I gain 800 Life Points!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:12.260
And with that, your "Galaxy Mirror Sage" is banished and you can't use that trick again.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:19.020
And once again, I activate the effect of my "Tachyon Downfall Cannon"!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.690
By halving its attack again, it can attack a third time!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.690
Neo Tachyon, direct attack!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.580
Ka- Kaito-<i>sama</i>, I will protect you...

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:39.920
I activate the effect of "Tachyon Downfall Cannon"!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.420
Attack him directly!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.470
No...! Stop it already!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.010
And now, the final attack.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:55.260
I activate "Tachyon Downfall Cannon"!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.430
Direct Attack!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.610
Brother!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.200
Kaito!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.960
I set 1 card and end my turn!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:30.550
Damage to systems... 90%

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.470
Energy remaining... 3%

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:37.180
It looks like our match seems to have ended.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.690
Ka-   Kaito... <i>sama</i>...

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.240
Kaito... Kaitooo!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.620
<i>Kaito! Come on! Kaito! Kaito!</i>

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.210
Is it you, Yuma?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.750
Yeah, it's me! You okay? OY!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.210
Tsukumo Yuma...

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.340
Mizael! Listen to me, please!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.420
There's no reason for you two to fight like this!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:15.090
You saw it too! Your real past!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:19.640
Your noble soul was poisoned by Don Thousand,

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.100
when he embedded the false memories.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:27.110
You were to be cast into the Barian World, by your heart full of hatred and sorrow.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:31.900
Don Thousand is the entire reason for all this fighting.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.700
That's wrong...

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.700
That doesn't matter at all!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:42.200
I fight for the Barians' sake! As one of the Seven Barian Emperors!

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:43.750
But, Mizael!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.170
There's no one left for you to protect.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.500
What do you mean?!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:51.170
Don Thousand and Vector joined forces... So Alito and Girag...

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.130
But not just them... Merag and Durbe too...!

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.340
They all were swallowed!

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.550
No way!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.510
It's true, Mizael.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:03.100
There are no Barians left for you to protect anymore.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.980
And as long as you keep using Neo Tachyon,

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.860
you can't escape from Don Thousand's curse!

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.820
Tha-... that's...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.490
My Neo Tachyon... is Don Thousand's curse...?

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.990
That... that's absurd!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.580
It's true, it's a curse! Therefore-

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.500
Astral.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.790
I am the only one who can release him from Neo Tachyon's spell.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:28.580
Kaito?!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.130
This Duel is the Duel that'll decide our future...

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.550
Your meddling in there is pointless...

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:38.260
But Kaito... With your body ragged like this...

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.680
If you go on like this, you will...!

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:43.390
Yuma...

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.020
Remember this...

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.900
We all... have to say...

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.980
... goodbye someday.

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:53.110
Sometimes, all of a sudden...

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.030
The same goes for you and Astral.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:02.080
So... you better get used to that...

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.200
Kaito.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:10.170
This is probably the last turn.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.960
This is the moment of truth, Mizael!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.800
My turn! Draw!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.010
You're still going to continue this Duel!?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:23.850
Your Galaxy-Eyes has been plucked away,
and you've lost all your strength by now!

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.850
No, the future is...

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:29.060
The light of our future hasn't faded away yet.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:30.690
What?!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.900
Now, be reborn!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:37.570
Embodiment of the Light that guides the Future, Number 62!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:46.450
Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:55.250
Impossible! How did Prime Photon get back on your field!?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:59.550
I activated my Prime Photon's effect before...

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.800
When Prime Photon leaves the field,

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.100
when the same number of turns have passed as Overlay Units are attached to it,

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.520
it revives onto my field.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:12.310
When it got swallowed by your Tachyon Chaos Hole, the guy had 2 Overlay Units!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:17.360
So, since two turns have passed now,

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.030
he reveals himself again.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.910
Right now, Neo Tachyon's Attack is 250...

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.540
So if his attack hits,...

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.580
... Kaito will win!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.830
Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon...

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.380
But the strongest Dragon is my Neo Tachyon!

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.340
And the strongest Dragon Tamer is <i>ME</i>!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:44.050
I activate a Trap Card! "Over Tachyon Unit"!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:49.810
When I want to activate an effect of my Neo Tachyon on my field, that uses 's Chaos Overlay Units,

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:54.480
I can pay 500 Lifepoints to activate the effect!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.730
What?!

00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:00.190
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Dragon's effect activates!

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.450
The effects of all other cards on the field than this card are negated,

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.330
and returned to the state at the beginning of this turn!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.700
Time Tyrant!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:16.090
And since the effects of the "Tachyon Downfall Cannon" equipped to Neo Tachyon are negated,

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.960
its Attack returns to 4500 ATK!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.720
Plus, Prime Photon too returns to the state before it was summoned!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.390
Be gone, Prime Photon!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.150
Be gone, Prime Photon!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.150
What?!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.280
Why? Why didn't Prime Photon disappear?!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.370
Certainly, your Neo Tachyon

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.740
did rewind the whole time.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:52.620
But it can only rewind effects activated during this turn.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:57.290
Prime Photon's effect was activated two turns ago.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.380
You may be able to turn back the time,

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:03.170
but you can <i>not</i> control my future!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:08.470
Impossible! It exceeds my Neo Tachyon's effect!?

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:14.060
But my Neo Tachyon still has more Attack Points!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.520
Prime Photon can't attack!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.980
You think so?

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.940
What do you mean?!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.820
Here I go, Mizael!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:26.780
Prime Photon Dragon, attack Neo Tachyon!

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:30.120
Eternity Photon Stream!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.580
Slay back, Neo Tachyon!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.250
Ultimate Tachyon Spiral!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.720
Mizael, why are you a Dragon Tamer?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.090
What?

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.510
I don't know why you train them.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:54.060
Even though you are incapable of trusting other human beings, you do trust Dragons.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:57.310
Your eyes are as bleak as...

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:02.980
Like the Dragons' eyes depicted on that stone monument... those eyes are very similar.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.170
<i>Mother... Father...</i>

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.820
Don't you dare pity me!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:37.160
I'm not pitying you. I'm saying that the strongest Dragon Tamer is you.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:45.960
I just wanted save my little brother and my father.

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.760
I simply decided to use the Dragons.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.590
The power of the Galaxy-Eyes.

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:55.180
But meeting with that one card,

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:58.680
it lead me here, making me stronger all the time.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:01.640
It was my Galaxy-Eyes, that guided me...

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.150
... to meet Yuma and Astral.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.530
And to meet Ryouga and many other friends.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.400
Also, I was able to meet you.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.200
They all...

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:17.700
... even so I was so lonely
that I was unable to trust in anyone...

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.790
... they taught me power to believe in people.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.500
I wonder, Mizael...

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.710
... if there would be a next time we would meet,

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:30.260
... wouldn't you tell me, what happened to you?

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:32.550
Kaito...

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.470
Kaito, for god's sake, stop already!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.100
It's already more than...!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.560
Brother... don't...! I can't...!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:48.980
Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon's effect activates!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:52.900
On the turn this card is special summoned by its own effect,

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:58.620
During a battle, its Attack is multiplied by the number of Overlay Units that has atttached!

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:02.160
8000 ATK!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.500
Go! Galaxy-Eyes Prime Photon Dragon!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.750
That's the true form of our Galaxy-Eyes?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.290
Numeron Dragon...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.290
Kaito-<i>sama</i>...!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.480
You did it... Kaito-<i>sama</i>...

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:51.860
Orbital... You did well too.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.780
Finally you...  praised me...

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:58.320
Thank you... Kai-...

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:04.950
Darling... Thank you.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.540
Orbital.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.670
Kaito!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:19.340
Hey Kaito! Get a hold! Hey!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:22.010
Didn't you want to Duel with me again!?

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:24.810
You and me, we haven't settled things yet!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:29.770
Is that so? Then, we put that off for later on.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:34.520
Cut the crap! Get up! Just get up, you have to duel me!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.360
Don't cry, Yuma.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.440
You are... the final hope.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.570
Kaito!

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.280
Brother...!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:46.160
Kaito! You can't... you can't die!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:51.160
Father... I have no regrets.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.540
Haruto, you take care of Father.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.760
Kaito... Please forgive me.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:02.880
Brother! BROTHER!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.570
Mizael...

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.780
... follow...

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.990
... the path you believe in...

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.640
No way... Kaito is...

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.930
Kaito...

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.640
Kaito...

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.820
KAITO!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.370
Good, I've been waiting for you, Nasch!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:18.790
Right here is the place where we had our 'final battle', yeah?

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:23.380
And - <i>here</i> will be your burial ground!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:28.430
Just you wait, Vector! And Don Thousand!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:34.390
Don Thousand... You... Unforgivable!

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.400
Kaito... Kaito...

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:46.450
<i>Don't cry, Yuma. You are the last hope.</i>

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:56.120
Kotori, Astral. I made a decision, I won't cry anymore.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.420
I'm going to win this war.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:01.250
That's how I bring it to 'em!

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:02.590
Yuma.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:04.010
Yuma!

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:07.930
I'm coming, Vector! Don Thousand!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.300
{marker}

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.970
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:16.390
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.650
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:22.320
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:24.940
Let it go.

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.210
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:43.420
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:49.340
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:54.680
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.520
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.400
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.570
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:11.950
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.830
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.580
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:22.040
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.170
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:27.010
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.420
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.930
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:44.480
The hatred rising from his grief that he couldn't protect his friends from Vector...

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:48.030
clutches Nasch tightly in his shaking fists.

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:51.400
Who will be the victor of this ancient battle?

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:54.490
I will defeat you, no matter what!

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:56.240
Here is the Barian World!

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:58.160
This is the decisive battle, Yuma!

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.750
These are... Merag's and Durbe's...?!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.870
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.960
Sinister Memories! Nasch vs. Vector the Devil!!

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:08.960
I'll crush you, Vector!
